{"asset_key":"ep8/herohub_story_18411160","episode":"ep8","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"18411160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1841116001:0":{"text":"我以前从没想过，自己有一天竟然会来到亡灵的领地上生活，而且还处于失忆状态。","source_cn":"我以前从没想过，自己有一天竟然会来到亡灵的领地上生活，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8C6A08270C88E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1841116002:1":{"text":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","source_cn":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6695444FFD53652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1841116002":{"text":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","source_cn":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6695444FFD53652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1841116003:0":{"text":"啊……快别说了，简直太尴尬了！","source_cn":"啊……快别说了，简直太尴尬了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD439110B5A1F9B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1841116004:0":{"text":"从前为了给爱丝树立榜样，我一直努力在她面前维持一位哥哥该有的成熟稳重……现在可好，我完全暴露了。","source_cn":"从前为了给爱丝树立榜样，我一直努力在她面前维持一位哥哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC7529528223A691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen